[895.507, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 7/8 · Stretch\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Target:** 100k req/s peak, 10× the brief, at the same 99.95% availability and p99 under 50 ms. The 10k\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  design stays as the fallback and is not changed. The stretch gets its own section saying what changes at\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  100k and where the design breaks first. I'll start by measuring how far one machine scales.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
